        <mxCell id="a2" value="&lt;b&gt;LangGraph, agents/, core/&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#DCE6F1;strokeColor=#1F3864;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;align=center;spacingLeft=6;rounded=1;arcSize=22;" vertex="1" parent="app">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="140" width="255" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a3" value="&lt;b&gt;ONNX Runtime&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;reranker trên CPU&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#DCE6F1;strokeColor=#1F3864;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;align=center;spacingLeft=6;rounded=1;arcSize=22;" vertex="1" parent="app">
